{"id":"6fca065df2bf5fac","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness.md","title":"Gödel First Incompleteness","display":"thm-godel-first-incompleteness — Gödel First Incompleteness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness","aliases":["67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-godel-first-incompleteness — Gödel First Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","[[67-df-consistent]]","[[67-df-godel-sentence]]","[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":2,"source_label":"Theorem 1","source_printed_pages":23,"source_pdf_pages":34,"source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-first-incompleteness — Gödel First Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f78588027495114a\" href=\"?note=f78588027495114a\" title=\"67-df-godel-sentence\">67-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"34"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 使用固定原始递归公理呈示、自然编号与标准证明公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f78588027495114a\" href=\"?note=f78588027495114a\" title=\"67-df-godel-sentence\">67-df-godel-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为标准算术模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathbb N\\models G\\land T\\nvdash G\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow T\\nvdash\\neg G).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathbb N\\models G\\land T\\nvdash G\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow T\\nvdash\\neg G).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Theorem 2.1, p.23。若 T⊢G，逐数可证明性得到 Q⊢Prov_T(⌜G⌝)，固定点给出 T⊢¬G，违背一致性。因此 G 不可证；标准模型中可证明性为假，固定点得到 G 为真。¬G 是假 Σ1 句，Σ1-sound 排除其可证性。新增真实性结论，并恢复原书的 Σ1-sound 术语。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"f78588027495114a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 使用固定原始递归公理呈示、自然编号与标准证明公式；$\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-consistent]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 使用固定原始递归公理呈示、自然编号与标准证明公式；$\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-consistent]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"f78588027495114a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)$ 见 [[67-df-godel-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 见 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]；$\\mathbb N$ 为标准算术模型。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)$ 见 [[67-df-godel-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 见 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]；$\\mathbb N$ 为标准算术模型。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\ &\\mathbb N\\models G\\land T\\nvdash G\\\\\n&\\land(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow T\\nvdash\\neg G).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1734,"backlinks":[{"id":"bb9a1d5e360bf758","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"87f4e115bf0f1121","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fbcaa556e59d96b1","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"源证明对每个 $T$ 公理的有限合取 $\\chi$，有效取 $Q+\\chi$ 的 Gödel 固定点 $G_\\chi$（[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]）。一致性给出 $Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi$，故逻辑不能证明 $\\chi\\to G_\\chi$。原书 Theorem2.4 的内部推导给 $\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi$；Corollary1.8 的本质反身性又给 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}$，因此 $T\\vdash G_\\chi$。将 $\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi$ 代入 [[67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]] 得结果；若理论有限，则可合取后删除冗余，直接有结论。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]；[[../67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness]]；[[../67-thm-lob]]；[[../67-thm-complexity-lower-bound]]；[[../67-thm-proof-speedup]]；[[../67-thm-formalized-lob]]；[[../67-thm-formalized-second-incompleteness]]；[[../67-thm-consistency-numeration-variation]]"}],"outgoing":["ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","9f0e08fd1022847c","f78588027495114a","b0667bf165ad62df"]}